  "app_swf_sha256": "d7a179998b6fc07e7a5efc87bdacb21399d5ac48f7ac5e87ef2f0743d5ee99db",
  "notes": [
    "No password, saved account cache, token, or user profile is read or copied.",
    "Account selection coordinates require the complete recognized box login page.",
    "Game start, save slots and map recognizers reuse existing bounty-candle sources.",
    "Windows v1.2 through v1.9 use the same 940x590 stage, saved-account ComboBox (370,110), scale 2.5, and game4 button (110,450), scale 2.2. v1.2 names the same view LoginPanel; v1.3 uses LoginLayer; v1.4 only adds wrench buttonMode.",
    "Identity is verified by AIR application id, executable path, PID and the selected window. Versions are not selected by enumerating the first AIR window.",
    "v1.8.1 changes the login endpoint to HTTPS. Earlier client network/authentication defects are outside the assistant; an existing logged-in window remains usable, but automatic relogin depends on the box server connection.",
    "TownMap caches levels_container within a process; a fresh process restores curRecord.areaId but not that scroll position. Returning to a map is confirmed independently of target visibility; each next round re-localizes and restores the viewport when needed."
  ],
